Subject: [PATCH] explorer: Do not show the standalone systray on Android.

Android has no host systray to dock icons into, so the standalone systray
window floated over the top left corner of every program. It can still be
turned on with the ShowSystray setting.
---
--- a/programs/explorer/desktop.c
+++ b/programs/explorer/desktop.c
@@ -979,6 +979,11 @@
         RegCloseKey( hkey );
     }
 
+#ifdef __ANDROID__
+    /* Android has no host systray to dock into, so the standalone systray window
+     * would float over the top left corner of every program */
+    if (!found) return FALSE;
+#endif
     /* Default on */
     if (!found) result = TRUE;
     return result;
